'''Triumphant Light''' (Japanese: '''超克の光''' ''Transcendent Light'') is the second themed booster pack, and fourth expansion overall, in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Triumphant Light''' is the second themed booster pack released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. The expansion focuses on {{p|Arceus}}, which appears as a {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}}. Some of the Pokémon in the expansion feature special {{TCG|Ability|Abilities}} called {{TCGP|Link Ability|Link Abilities}}, which are activated if the player has Arceus or Arceus ex in play.

As an extension of {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}}, which focused on [[Generation IV]] Pokémon and characters from the [[Sinnoh]] region, Triumphant Light features some characters from the historical [[Hisui]] region—the setting of [[Pokémon Legends: Arceus]]—such as [[Adaman]] and [[Irida]].

